+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Three reports contradict the README business rules: lower-case SKUs are refused as unknown products, a basket of exactly €50.00 is charged shipping, and line VAT is rounded down instead of half up.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- SKU lookup canonicalises its input (trim, upper case), so `lb-220` finds `LB-220` when ordering.
+- Free shipping applies when goods are €50.00 or more (the boundary is inclusive).
+- Line VAT is rounded half up to the cent (€1.99 at 22% gives €0.44).
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `product-catalog`: SKU identification is case-insensitive and ignores surrounding spaces.
+- `shipping`: shipping cost by weight, free from €50.00 of goods.
+- `vat`: per-line VAT rounded half up.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/catalog.ts` (`find`), `src/shipping.ts` (`shippingCost`), `src/tax.ts` (`lineVat`); tests in `test/`. No API changes.
