+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+
+Prices the delivery of an order by parcel weight, with free shipping for larger baskets.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Free shipping from €50.00
+Shipping SHALL be free when the goods, after every discount and before VAT, come to €50.00 or more.
+
+#### Scenario: Exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are €50.00
+- **THEN** shipping is €0.00
+
+#### Scenario: Just below
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are €49.99 and the parcel weighs up to 1 kg
+- **THEN** shipping is €4.90
